      418   DEFINE QUERY br-drt-prop FOR
      419         tt-drt-prop SCROLLING.
      420   DEFINE QUERY Dialog-Frame FOR
      421         tt-dis-rule SCROLLING.
      422   DEFINE BROWSE br-drt-prop
