      427   tt-drt-prop.property-value COLUMN-LABEL "Значение" FORMAT "X(255)" WIDTH 58
      428       WITH NO-ROW-MARKERS SEPARATORS SIZE 98 BY 9.87 FIT-LAST-COLUMN.
      429   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      430        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      431        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11
      432        tt-dis-rule.templ-rl-root AT ROW 1 COL 43 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 4
      433             LABEL "Код шаблона"
